component.vcredist64.description=Visual Studio 2022 x64 Redistributables
component.vcredist64.progress=Installing Visual Studio 2022 x64 Redistributables
component.vcredist64.warning=Installation of MS Visual Studio 2022 x64 Redistributables failed!\nError Code: ${program_exit_code}\nCheck if another version was already installed and if not, try to run the installer manually from\n${installdir}\\vcredist\\\n\nThe installation will now continue, but swift might not work properly. If this is the case, raise an issue at https://github.com/swift-project/pilotclient/issues with the error code, you received.

component.vcredist32.description=Visual Studio 2019 x86 Redistributables
component.vcredist32.progress=Installing Visual Studio 2019 x86 Redistributables
component.vcredist32.warning=Installation of MS Visual Studio 2019 x86 Redistributables failed!\nError Code: ${program_exit_code}\nCheck if another version was already installed and if not, try to run the installer manually from\n${installdir}\\vcredist\\\n\nThe installation will now continue, but swift might not work properly. If this is the case, raise an issue at https://github.com/swift-project/pilotclient/issues with the error code, you received.

